# Email Configuration for Phishing Trainer
# Replace the values below with your actual credentials

# Gmail SMTP Configuration (Recommended for testing)
SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-16-character-app-password-here
FROM_EMAIL=your-email@gmail.com

# Session Secret (change this to a random string)
SESSION_SECRET=change-this-to-a-random-secret-key-in-production

# Database (optional - defaults to SQLite)
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///phishing_training.db

# ========================================
# INSTRUCTIONS TO GET GMAIL APP PASSWORD:
# ========================================
# 1. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Enable 2-Step Verification if not already enabled
# 3. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Select "Mail" and "Other (Custom name)"
# 5. Enter "Phishing Trainer" as the name
# 6. Click "Generate"
# 7. Copy the 16-character password (no spaces)
# 8. Paste it above as SMTP_PASSWORD
# 9. Replace SMTP_USERNAME and FROM_EMAIL with your Gmail address
#
# Example:
# SMTP_USERNAME=john.smith@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=abcd efgh ijkl mnop  (remove spaces: abcdefghijklmnop)
# FROM_EMAIL=john.smith@gmail.com
#
# ========================================
# ALTERNATIVE: Use SendGrid (100 free emails/day)
# ========================================
# 1. Sign up at: https://sendgrid.com
# 2. Verify your sender email
# 3. Get API key from Settings → API Keys
# 4. Uncomment and fill in:
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.your-api-key-here
# FROM_EMAIL=verified-sender@yourdomain.com
#
# ========================================
# ALTERNATIVE: Use Resend (100 free emails/day)
# ========================================
# 1. Sign up at: https://resend.com
# 2. Get API key
# 3. Uncomment and fill in:
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your-api-key-here
# FROM_EMAIL=onboarding@resend.dev
